<title>USA: Calif. $265 mln water deal repriced, yields cut.</title>
<headline>Calif. $265 mln water deal repriced, yields cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said Tuesday it repriced California's $265.2 million Department of Water Resources bonds, lowering yields in several maturities and cutting the top yield in 2029 to 5.72 percent from 5.73 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
