<p>RE: $265,190,000*</p>
<p>DEPARTMENT OF WATER RESOURCES</p>
<p>CENTRAL VALLEY PROJECT, WATER SYSTEM REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>SERIES Q</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD ON THE FOLLOWING.</p>
